#: ../../../plus/debug-tools/blackmagic.rst:62
msgid ""
"Black Magic Probe has 2 serial ports: UART and GDB. We will need \"GDB\" "
"port. Please use :ref:`piohome` > Devices or :ref:`piocore` and :ref:"
"`cmd_device_list` command to list available ports. If you do not see \"Black "
"Magic Probe GDB\" port, please try both. More `details <https://github.com/"
"blacksphere/blackmagic/wiki/Useful-GDB-commands#connecting-gdb-to-the-black-"
"magic-probe>`_."
msgstr ""

